Restart the LRM on a node with a started HA resource while the stack is disarmed
in 'ignore' mode (services keep their previous state).

Without the fix this hangs forever: shutdown_request flips the mode to 'restart',
the work loop re-acquires the agent lock and reopens the watchdog, then waits in
'active' for the disarmed master to freeze services - which it never does.

With the fix the LRM exits in one tick without touching lock or watchdog.
